Reviewed-by: Ross Zwisler <zwisler@google.com>
(cherry picked from commit b54c7f53a988395e29885c74c69531ba3148e835)
[Cherry picked from chromeos-5.10 tree. Minor tweaks to commit message
to match Android style]
